### **③ Definisikan Endpoint di ApiService**

Semua endpoint terpusat di satu file. **Jangan buat `ApiService` sendiri di modul masing-masing.**

```kotlin
// core/network/ApiService.kt
interface ApiService {

    // ─── AUTH (Azfa) ────────────────────────────────────────
    @POST("auth/login")
    suspend fun login(@Body request: LoginRequest): Response<LoginResponse>

    @POST("auth/register")
    suspend fun register(@Body request: RegisterRequest): Response<RegisterResponse>

    // ─── DASHBOARD & IoT (Adam) ─────────────────────────────
    @GET("sensor/latest")
    suspend fun getLatestSensorData(): Response<SensorResponse>

    @POST("device/control")
    suspend fun controlDevice(@Body command: DeviceCommand): Response<CommandResponse>

    // ─── SMART FARMING (Joya) ───────────────────────────────
    @GET("plants")
    suspend fun getPlantList(): Response<PlantListResponse>

    @POST("tanamcare/diagnose")
    @Multipart
    suspend fun diagnosePlant(@Part image: MultipartBody.Part): Response<DiagnoseResponse>

    // ─── MARKETPLACE (Evan) ─────────────────────────────────
    @GET("market/products")
    suspend fun getProducts(@Query("category") category: String?): Response<ProductListResponse>

    @GET("market/products/{id}")
    suspend fun getProductDetail(@Path("id") productId: String): Response<ProductResponse>
}
```

Koordinasikan penambahan endpoint baru dengan Adam (sebagai maintainer `core/network/`) sebelum merge ke master.

