### **⑤ Buat ViewModel**

ViewModel mengorkestrasi data antara Repository dan UI. Gunakan `StateFlow` untuk semua state.

```kotlin
// ui/farming/FarmingViewModel.kt
@HiltViewModel
class FarmingViewModel @Inject constructor(
    private val farmingRepository: FarmingRepository
) : ViewModel() {

    // State untuk data sensor
    private val _sensorState = MutableStateFlow<NetworkResult<SensorResponse>>(NetworkResult.Loading)
    val sensorState: StateFlow<NetworkResult<SensorResponse>> = _sensorState.asStateFlow()

    // State untuk diagnosis
    private val _diagnoseState = MutableStateFlow<NetworkResult<DiagnoseResponse>?>(null)
    val diagnoseState: StateFlow<NetworkResult<DiagnoseResponse>?> = _diagnoseState.asStateFlow()

    init {
        fetchSensorData()
    }

    fun fetchSensorData() {
        viewModelScope.launch {
            _sensorState.value = NetworkResult.Loading
            _sensorState.value = farmingRepository.getLatestSensorData()
        }
    }

    fun diagnosePlant(imageFile: File) {
        viewModelScope.launch {
            _diagnoseState.value = NetworkResult.Loading
            _diagnoseState.value = farmingRepository.diagnosePlant(imageFile)
        }
    }
}
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Gunakan `StateFlow`, bukan `LiveData`.** Proyek ini sepenuhnya berbasis Kotlin Coroutines. `LiveData` hanya boleh digunakan jika ada kebutuhan legacy yang sangat spesifik dan harus dikonsultasikan dulu.

